  <item>
    <title>【园仔的书芽】INFJ低能量人躲进书店寻找精神处方丨Vol.06</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6db84fab3a91c24a0e1a3f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6db84fab3a91c24a0e1a3f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏日出门对低能量的人来说是件消耗满满的事。</span></p><p><span>特别是挤着人潮赶场市集，对着络绎的人流招呼，半天下来连说话的力气都不剩了。</span></p><p><span>但这次，我一个INFJ低能量人在杭州赶市集摆摊，却意外在市集旁找到了专属于低能量人的充电宝地。</span></p><p><span>本期内容我们就一起来看：杭州天目里的这家茑屋书店，到底有什么特别的地方，又有哪三本好书想要安利给大家。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nsg1NtM380PTeoIpru2-5Pb_45Lh.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nn4ESuj46WY1uer64uQOm0iFPic-.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmbCY8uaiQDcfNYXJOuf7NEwSXt.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nuiGwUhBaFiPaEf_ZcVysR0MHwmm.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqqaHA88x49vNfcY9yy824T67XGB.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmrC18_icc8RYS6e2kPcLEzhssLj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJEgud-shmcLMlwl-vRs9yWPCxc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8llX_PFZjivCRJRnMQTyBag8wa.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
